      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Pick leads\nRuns weekdays 08:00 (Europe/Istanbul) or manually. Reads rows from \"Texprove Leads\" / \"Leads\" where Stage = New, max 10 per run.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "ca04c164-d977-4e07-83af-0041771b84c3",
      "name": "Note: Pick leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        144,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Research each lead\nOne lead at a time. \"Research with Claude\" is the Anthropic node (Claude Sonnet 4.6) with Claude's built-in web search switched on (max 8 searches per company): Claude searches, reads the pages itself and answers with one JSON object. If that call fails (credits exhausted, rate limit, outage), the error output runs the same call on \"Research with Claude (account 2)\" with the second Anthropic credential. \"Parse Research\" pulls the JSON out of either reply. It never invents facts; unknown fields stay empty.",
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "a7cf30da-6d99-4285-92f0-5e4792ad50a0",
      "name": "Note: Research",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        624,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Write back\nUpdates the row (match on Lead ID). Stage = Researched, or \"Research failed\" when the agent errors or returns an empty personalisation hook. \"Log Research\" appends the agent's output and the decision to the Log tab.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "f63d3eaa-9600-489e-ad20-64a0f5d015f9",
      "name": "Note: Write back",
